      "text": "The main campus of the University of Mount Saint Vincent, set on a scenic riverfront site in Riverdale, Bronx. Features academic buildings, six residence halls, the Peter Jay Sharp Athletic and Recreation Center, and the historic Lourdes Grotto (est. 1873). All faculties and schools are located on this single campus.",
